{"id":"d3e080ab4c9d9e0a","group":"56","path":"56/56-lem-trace-ancestor-laws.md","title":"祖先逆像的单位、复合与置换律","display":"lem-trace-ancestor-laws — 祖先逆像的单位、复合与置换律","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-lem-trace-ancestor-laws","aliases":["56-lem-trace-ancestor-laws"],"display":"lem-trace-ancestor-laws — 祖先逆像的单位、复合与置换律","depends_on":["[[56-df-trace-ancestors]]","[[56-lem-trace-permutation]]"],"source_section":"§8.6.1 Definition 8.6.7; §8.6.2 Definition 8.6.27","source_printed_pages":"389,397–398","source_statement_status":"local-relational-corollary-of-source-definitions","source_proof_status":"inverse-image-expansion-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-lem-trace-ancestor-laws"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-lem-trace-ancestor-laws</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-trace-ancestor-laws — 祖先逆像的单位、复合与置换律"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c39af7178b60264b\" href=\"?note=c39af7178b60264b\" title=\"56-df-trace-ancestors\">56-df-trace-ancestors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8070a21336326571\" href=\"?note=8070a21336326571\" title=\"56-lem-trace-permutation\">56-lem-trace-permutation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.6.1 Definition 8.6.7; §8.6.2 Definition 8.6.27"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"389,397–398"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"local-relational-corollary-of-source-definitions"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"inverse-image-expansion-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m,\\operatorname{PT}_R,S_R,T_R,\\operatorname{Id}_R,\\bullet\">\\(\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m,\\operatorname{PT}_R,S_R,T_R,\\operatorname{Id}_R,\\bullet\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c39af7178b60264b\" href=\"?note=c39af7178b60264b\" title=\"56-df-trace-ancestors\">56-df-trace-ancestors</a>；置换关系及Trace Lemma见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8070a21336326571\" href=\"?note=8070a21336326571\" title=\"56-lem-trace-permutation\">56-lem-trace-permutation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\{\\mathrm d,\\mathrm s\\}\">\\(m\\in\\{\\mathrm d,\\mathrm s\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R\">\\(\\phi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_R(\\phi)=S_R(\\psi)\">\\(T_R(\\phi)=S_R(\\psi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_R(\\chi)=T_R(\\psi)\">\\(T_R(\\chi)=T_R(\\psi)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(T_R(\\psi))\">\\(P,Q\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(T_R(\\psi))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\">\\(A\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\operatorname{Id}_R(s),A)=A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\operatorname{Id}_R(s),A)=A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\phi\\bullet\\psi,P)\n=\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\phi,\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,P)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\phi\\bullet\\psi,P)\n=\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\phi,\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,P)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq Q\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,P)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P\\subseteq Q\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,P)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,P\\cup Q)=\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,P)\\cup\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,P\\cup Q)=\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,P)\\cup\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\approx_R\\chi\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,P)=\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\chi,P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\psi\\approx_R\\chi\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,P)=\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\chi,P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>单位式展开对角关系。复合式左右均等价于存在中间位置v和目标位置w∈P，使源位置沿φ到v、沿ψ到w。单调与并保持直接展开存在量词；置换式由Trace Lemma的关系相等得到。这里只使用逆像运算，不要求关系为函数，也没有不成立的交保持断言。</p>\n<p>来源为本地DjVu所给trace复合与样本定义的直接关系论推论；本原子给出本地证明，不把它冒称为原书另行编号的定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-trace-ancestors","status":"resolved","id":"c39af7178b60264b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-trace-ancestors]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-lem-trace-permutation","status":"resolved","id":"8070a21336326571","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-lem-trace-permutation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-trace-ancestors","status":"resolved","id":"c39af7178b60264b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m,\\operatorname{PT}_R,S_R,T_R,\\operatorname{Id}_R,\\bullet$ 见 [[56-df-trace-ancestors]]；置换关系及Trace Lemma见 [[56-lem-trace-permutation]]。$m\\in\\{\\mathrm d,\\mathrm s\\}$，$s\\in T$，$\\phi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R$，$T_R(\\phi)=S_R(\\psi)$，$T_R(\\chi)=T_R(\\psi)$。$P,Q\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(T_R(\\psi))$，$A\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(s)$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-lem-trace-permutation","status":"resolved","id":"8070a21336326571","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m,\\operatorname{PT}_R,S_R,T_R,\\operatorname{Id}_R,\\bullet$ 见 [[56-df-trace-ancestors]]；置换关系及Trace Lemma见 [[56-lem-trace-permutation]]。$m\\in\\{\\mathrm d,\\mathrm s\\}$，$s\\in T$，$\\phi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R$，$T_R(\\phi)=S_R(\\psi)$，$T_R(\\chi)=T_R(\\psi)$。$P,Q\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(T_R(\\psi))$，$A\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(s)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m,\\operatorname{PT}_R,S_R,T_R,\\operatorname{Id}_R,\\bullet","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\{\\mathrm d,\\mathrm s\\}","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R","display":false},{"tex":"T_R(\\phi)=S_R(\\psi)","display":false},{"tex":"T_R(\\chi)=T_R(\\psi)","display":false},{"tex":"P,Q\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(T_R(\\psi))","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\operatorname{Id}_R(s),A)=A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\phi\\bullet\\psi,P)\n=\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\phi,\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,P)).","display":true},{"tex":"P\\subseteq Q\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,P)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,Q).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,P\\cup Q)=\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,P)\\cup\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,Q).","display":true},{"tex":"\\psi\\approx_R\\chi\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\psi,P)=\\operatorname{Anc}_R^m(\\chi,P).","display":true}],"bytes":2047,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-127","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-lem-trace-ancestor-laws.md]]"}],"outgoing":["c39af7178b60264b","8070a21336326571"]}